        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF145 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">Idempotency-Key</code> header. The key is sent in requests to indicate that a POST/PATCH is a particular unique command. If the server gets the same request with the same key it ignores it.</p>
<p dir="auto">This is draft.</p>
